  "question": {
    "text": "If the image of the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> in the plane <math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math> is the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>is equal to"
  },
